---
// WhatIsIt.astro
---

<section class="what-section contenedor" aria-labelledby="what-title">

  <div class="what-section__intro">
    <p>Welcome to ELIAC;</p>
    <p>the <b>European Linear Accelerator Challenge</b> for</p>
    <p>students in physics and engineering.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="what-section__content">
    <h2 class="what-section__title" id="what-title">What is it?</h2>
    <div class="what-section__body">
      <p>
        The European Linear Accelerator Challenge is the
        first international academic competition focused
        on electron linear accelerators. The goal is to
        achieve the complete design, simulation, and
        validation of a functional LINAC. Aimed at
        undergraduate and master's students in physics,
        engineering or related fields.
      </p>
      <p>See the full plan and phases of the challenge</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .what-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .what-section__intro {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--c-text);
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .what-section__title {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--c-text);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 625px;
  }

  .what-section__body {
    font-family: var(--ff-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--c-text);
    opacity: 0.85;
    max-width: 625px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .what-section__body p + p { margin-top: 1.25rem; }

  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .what-section__title,
    .what-section__body { max-width: 350px; }
  }
</style>
